# Normalise line endings. The repository was written on Windows in 2017 and most
# sources are still CRLF, which shows up as whole-file diffs for anyone on Linux
# or macOS. Text is stored LF in the repository and checked out native.
* text=auto

*.java   text diff=java
*.md     text
*.xml    text
*.yml    text
*.properties text

*.classpath text
*.project   text
*.iml       text

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.jar binary
